      "text": "My 4 year old daughter had a great experience in the futsol program. She learned the rudimentary skills to for beginner level soccer. A great experience and opportunity for her to learn how to take direction from a couch and be a part of team. It was a lot of fun for her and entertains for my wife and I.",
